OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested over death of
OL,4,A29-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of administering a substance
OL,8,Ffollowing the death of a 29-year-old
OL,9,Fman.
OL,11,FPolice and ambulance crews were called
OL,12,Fto Anglesea Road in Shirley,
OL,13,FSouthampton, on Tuesday at about 12:20
OL,14,FGMT.
OL,16,FThe man, from Southampton, was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,19,FThose arrested, aged 33, 36, and 42,
OL,20,Fhave also been held suspicion of
OL,21,Fperverting the course of justice. They
OL,22,Fall remain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
